# Strix live-app throwaway instance: disposable data dir + scratch.
# Only the SECRET-BEARING files are ignored — accounts.txt holds live throwaway
# API keys, scan.env holds the instance credentials, and data/ is a throwaway
# database. The harness scripts themselves (mint_scan_keys.sh,
# update_brief_creds.py) ARE tracked: they contain no secrets and are the
# reusable part.
tests/strix/data/
tests/strix/accounts.txt
tests/strix/scan.env
